{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The 2D Fighting Game With a Twist: It's Turn-Based! </strong></h2><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.poster.avif?t=1764224261\" width=500 height=281 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1492750/extras/be1b86e6027b753cfa0f34ebff3c6368.webm?t=1764224261\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br><br>Mega Knockdown is a fast-paced combo of turn-based strategy and classic 2D fighters. Get ready to jump right into the real challenge at the heart of fighting games: outsmarting your friends and predicting their next move!<br><br><strong>Gameplay Highlights</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Simple controls with no timing requirement<br></li><li>Deep strategy and challenging single player CPU opponents<br></li><li>Smooth online play, anywhere across the globe! <br></li><li>Play a fighting game at your own pace: take your turns slowly and strategically, or raise your heartbeat with BLITZ time settings!<br></li><li>Meet colorful hand-drawn characters: the fireball-throwing slacker, the grappler with a heart of gold, the burnout haunted by a long-limbed spirit, and more!<br></li><li>Jockey for position and weave in and out of range of attacks. Are you a true master of fighting game footsies? Prove it!<br></li><li>Get the upper hand on your opponents with a knockdown, and press the advantage with a 'meaty attack' on their wakeup!<br></li><li>Express yourself! Do you carefully block and punish your way to victory, or do you assert dominance with a wild and aggressive gameplan?</li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Modes and Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Arcade Mode (with story scenes)<br></li><li>Online Multiplayer Lobbies<br></li><li>Local Versus<br></li><li>Interactive Tutorial<br></li><li>Survival Mode<br></li><li>Blitz speed variants<br></li><li>Training Mode with frame data display<br></li><li>Replays Viewer<br></li><li>Controller Support<br></li><li>Accessible difficulty settings<br></li><li>8 Playable Characters<br></li><li>3 Selectable Art Styles<br></li><li>Swappable, moddable character color palettes</li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"I Have a Yellow Belt in Shotokan Karate","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/6771b422b01b1d2406a793403d8b9fe4e312dffb.jpg"},{"name":"I'm a Hundredaire","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/0b940f46268e5df48fff3f65ff9461995478fce2.jpg"},{"name":"I Am The Greatest!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/154b65013fec29a0c37d2fd14ab0d09692c33605.jpg"},{"name":"In This Moment, I Am Euphoric","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/e9b82919dbfff04c298ed75a744e8cfadfb5232c.jpg"},{"name":"I Must Proceed at a High Velocity","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/7b0ee9c9a64de07d3bdde5f5028068e345c09c9e.jpg"},{"name":"I Can See The Frames!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/f952d2bd2cae18fead80e3651b9184fd43cb0521.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Basically A Lab Monster","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/f7abead2b06059425330a3b0fd17a63d7aca7a9c.jpg"},{"name":"I'm Not Here To Make Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/aa611e0cd32531c7b04e891141df2bd32618234c.jpg"},{"name":"STEP INTO THE PAUL ZONE","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/1492750/a4a8c650a14c6d1a4ae402f8ea0df660605937b9.jpg"},{"name":"I Definitely Have Friends","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/ste